sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant GH as Git 平台
    participant API as FastAPI 接入层
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Q as Broker
    participant W as Celery Worker
    participant GIT as 仓库缓存
    participant TS as Tree-sitter
    participant LLM as 大模型
    participant KB as 知识库

    GH->>API: POST /webhooks/github
    Note over API: 用 webhook_secret 校验 X-Hub-Signature-256
    API->>DB: INSERT webhook_deliveries
    alt dedupe_key 唯一键冲突（重复投递）
        DB-->>API: UniqueViolation
        API-->>GH: 200 duplicate（不重复分析）
    else 首次投递
        API->>DB: INSERT analysis_runs status = queued
        API->>Q: enqueue run_id
        API-->>GH: 202 Accepted
        Q->>W: 投递任务
        W->>DB: status = cloning
        W->>GIT: fetch base_sha 与 head_sha
        W->>GIT: git diff base..head
        W->>DB: 写 changed_files
        W->>DB: status = parsing
        W->>GIT: 取变更后文件全文
        W->>TS: 解析受影响函数的 AST
        TS-->>W: entities 与 relations
        W->>DB: upsert code_entities / entity_relations
        W->>DB: 读受影响实体 + 一跳调用关系
        W->>DB: status = analyzing
        W->>LLM: chat system_prompt + context + json_schema
        LLM-->>W: PlantUML / JSON
        W->>DB: 写 ai_invocations
        W->>W: plantuml -checkonly 编译校验
        alt 编译或 schema 校验失败 且 已重试次数 < 2
            W->>LLM: 回灌错误日志 请求修复
            LLM-->>W: 修正后的 PlantUML
            W->>W: 再次校验
        end
        W->>DB: 写 documents / document_revisions
        W->>DB: status = rendering
        W->>KB: 发布文档 + PR 评论
        W->>DB: status = succeeded
    end
